WEBVTT

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.440
Synchro Summon!

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:09.020
Take flight, Black-Winged Dragon!

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:15.960
You sacrificed yourself to 
summon a Synchro Monster?

00:00:16.260 --> 00:00:20.830
You said that friends fight each other, 
but that's not the only side to humanity.

00:00:20.830 --> 00:00:26.080
We can also fight together by passing 
on my emotions to my friends.

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:28.540
It's called a bond.

00:00:28.870 --> 00:00:30.360
Bond...

00:00:31.930 --> 00:00:34.470
It was a bit rough this time.

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:38.740
Yusei, I leave the rest to you.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:41.940
Yusei...

00:00:42.070 --> 00:00:43.190
Do your best.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:46.170
Yeah!  Take care of Jack and Crow!

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:50.860
Team 5D's is down to their 
last Wheeler Yusei Fudo.

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:55.480
It's the climax of the WRGP Finals!

00:00:56.420 --> 00:01:01.270
I don't know why Crow left 
you a Synchro Monster.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:06.820
Since Meklord Emperor Granel can 
absorb your Synchro Monster,

00:01:06.820 --> 00:01:10.870
it only serves as a parting 
gift before you go to hell.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:13.620
He made a dumb choice.

00:01:13.890 --> 00:01:17.170
He could've survived for another turn.

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:19.840
I don't care how a weakling dies.

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:21.640
The problem is Yusei Fudo.

00:01:23.070 --> 00:01:24.940
Don't underestimate him.

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:26.990
You're always flattering him.

00:01:27.240 --> 00:01:29.550
I'll be the one to defeat him.

00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:33.860
When our true powers 
activate, I'll defeat him.

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:39.260
Why did Crow summon Black-Winged Dragon?

00:01:39.260 --> 00:01:40.750
I don't know.

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:48.060
If Meklord Emperor absorbs both Black-Winged 
Dragon and Red Nova Dragon, we're out of options.

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:59.110
Yusei, get to that card...

00:02:02.150 --> 00:02:09.550
I know why Crow left me the Synchro 
Monster Black-Winged Dragon.

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:19.200
Everything we learned is 
from our WRGP battles.

00:02:20.190 --> 00:02:23.660
We're not battling with our individual decks.

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:26.110
We're battling with three decks!

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:28.100
Here I go, Jose!

00:02:28.660 --> 00:02:29.590
Duel!

00:02:31.820 --> 00:02:32.870
My turn!

00:02:34.930 --> 00:02:38.130
I summon Wave Wall in defense position!

00:02:38.410 --> 00:02:40.850
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:02:42.330 --> 00:02:45.540
Crow, I promise to get to that card!

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:49.340
Riding Duels.

00:02:49.660 --> 00:02:52.460
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:02:52.740 --> 00:02:59.290
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:06.900
Run!  The road of evolution 
leading to tomorrow

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:11.270
Is a new legendary duel

00:03:23.750 --> 00:03:28.350
Throw away all feelings of failure

00:03:29.320 --> 00:03:33.990
Set free your infinite potential

00:03:34.360 --> 00:03:39.430
Every beginning is up to you

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:45.940
Everyone is lost  Pursue the light

00:03:46.570 --> 00:03:51.280
Losing sight of fleeting dreams

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:57.120
Connect the bond and you'll never lose

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:04.920
Become the gale and dance  
Cut through the darkness

00:04:05.190 --> 00:04:10.290
Even if you can't see your destination

00:04:10.460 --> 00:04:15.830
Run on your feet without fear

00:04:16.070 --> 00:04:21.370
On this road that leads to tomorrow

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:28.410
Going my way!!  Break through and go!

00:04:42.830 --> 00:04:48.230
Road to Destruction!Future 
Due to Synchro Summon

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:55.610
I see.  He knew it would lead to destruction,

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:59.390
but he couldn't stop himself 
from Synchro Summoning.

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:05.780
How pathetic.  I'll lower the curtain 
on this duel and on foolish humans.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:07.470
My turn!

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:15.430
Meklord Emperor Granel attacks Black-Winged 
Dragon with its 15500 attack points.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:18.500
This is bad!  If this attack 
succeeds, Granel Attack's

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:22.290
piercing damage effect will eliminate 
all of Yusei's life points!

00:05:23.080 --> 00:05:23.890
Yusei!

00:05:27.690 --> 00:05:30.520
I activate Wave Wall's effect!

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:36.470
For every Synchro Monster on my field, 
your monster's attack is negated once!

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:45.690
Nice!  As long as he has the Synchro Monster 
Black-Winged Dragon, he can avoid Granel's attack.

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:50.710
Meklord Emperor is one monster made up of 
five monsters, so Granel can only attack once.

00:05:51.530 --> 00:05:55.130
No matter how many attack points 
it has, if it can't attack...

00:05:55.130 --> 00:05:57.420
It's the same as a monster 
with 0 attack points!

00:05:58.300 --> 00:05:59.410
He's doing well.

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:01.060
That's right, Yusei.

00:06:01.930 --> 00:06:06.570
Survive until I can finish you.

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:09.650
I activate the trap Attack Cannon!

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:13.730
When Meklord Emperor fails to 
destroy your monster in battle...

00:06:13.730 --> 00:06:20.220
I can send Granel Attack on my field to the 
graveyard to destroy one of your monsters.

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:23.510
Fire!  Annihilate Black-Winged Dragon!

00:06:25.160 --> 00:06:26.740
Black-Winged Dragon!

00:06:29.540 --> 00:06:32.540
Crow, I will fulfill your wishes!

00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:36.230
I flip over my trap card Shadow Impulse!

00:06:36.370 --> 00:06:38.710
Crow left him that trap.

00:06:39.320 --> 00:06:42.750
When my Synchro Monster is destroyed...

00:06:42.860 --> 00:06:47.420
I can Special Summon a Synchro 
Monster with the same Level and Type

00:06:47.420 --> 00:06:51.440
by making its attack points become 
0 and negating its effects!

00:06:51.960 --> 00:06:54.450
Appear, Stardust Dragon!

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:00.270
I was waiting for that!

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:02.210
Stardust Dragon!

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:05.430
Stardust Dragon is a monster that evolves.

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:08.260
Evolving leads to that card!

00:07:09.160 --> 00:07:14.140
Yusei, get to Shooting Star Dragon.

00:07:14.780 --> 00:07:18.930
Avoiding Meklord Emperor's attack 
once isn't cause for celebration!

00:07:19.300 --> 00:07:27.260
Your bond can't defeat Granel, similar to 
how a bunch of ants can't defeat an elephant!

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:28.600
What?

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:32.560
An elephant doesn't know there 
are ants beneath its feet.

00:07:32.560 --> 00:07:34.790
It stomps them and keeps walking.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:42.550
Similar to how history doesn't care about 
humans, all your efforts are worthless!

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:47.480
My left arm resurrects with even more power!

00:07:49.090 --> 00:07:51.470
Granel Attack 3!

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:57.140
Meklord Emperor is whole again!

00:07:57.570 --> 00:08:04.370
When I have 4 or more Speed Counters, I can 
activate Speed Spell - Silent Burn from my hand.

00:08:04.370 --> 00:08:10.770
For every monster that didn't attack this 
turn, you take 300 points of damage!

00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:11.800
What?

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:16.640
Four parts didn't attack, so 
you take 1200 points of damage!

00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:20.520
The elephant's foot known as 
the future will stomp you!

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:38.730
If you were willing to be crushed instantly, 
you could've avoided pain and anguish.

00:08:39.060 --> 00:08:42.040
I set one card and end my turn!

00:08:42.540 --> 00:08:44.170
I won't give up!

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:49.740
Since you're trying to rewrite 
history, I'll keep fighting you!

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:52.980
You fool.  You're so childish.

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:57.710
I'll teach you the history 
of mankind's foolishness.

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:01.930
What's this?

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:04.310
The mark...

00:09:05.340 --> 00:09:06.290
What's this?

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:13.360
You're really going to show them?

00:09:13.670 --> 00:09:15.910
Jose, that's cruel!

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:21.420
What are you doing?

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:37.000
Where are we?

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:43.730
I'm going to fall!  Help me!

00:09:43.750 --> 00:09:44.660
We're floating?

00:09:45.070 --> 00:09:46.330
What happened?

00:09:46.690 --> 00:09:48.120
What happened to us?

00:09:48.570 --> 00:09:49.670
Yusei...

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:52.640
I saw this before inside the wormhole.

00:10:02.520 --> 00:10:03.770
What's this?

00:10:04.140 --> 00:10:05.610
What's going on?

00:10:05.960 --> 00:10:07.520
It's like a graveyard.

00:10:17.260 --> 00:10:18.190
Look!

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:23.620
No way!

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:24.700
This must be a joke!

00:10:25.450 --> 00:10:26.890
This place is...

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.170
That's right.

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:37.640
For us, it's the real world.  For 
you, it's the future Neo Domino City.

00:10:38.040 --> 00:10:39.290
What?

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:41.120
This is our future?

00:10:44.860 --> 00:10:48.820
It all started with Synchro Summons.

00:11:01.440 --> 00:11:06.940
Synchro Summon!

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:07.880
What's this?

00:11:09.590 --> 00:11:16.050
People's excitement towards dueling 
further evolved the world.

00:11:16.060 --> 00:11:20.470
Synchro Summons were the 
symbol of prosperity.

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:28.430
When you Synchro Summon, the D-Wheel 
creates waves that are linked to Moment.

00:11:28.430 --> 00:11:31.280
It resonated with Moment, 
which caused it to spin faster

00:11:31.280 --> 00:11:34.250
and speed up the evolution of the world.

00:11:34.250 --> 00:11:37.220
But it was too fast.

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:46.770
Evolve more!  Raise the Level more!  More!

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:50.440
Stop it!

00:12:01.840 --> 00:12:02.780
That's...

00:12:26.730 --> 00:12:27.970
It's war.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:29.560
How horrible.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:31.620
Look!

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:35.570
Lucciano?

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.340
These are memories of my era.

00:12:53.680 --> 00:12:55.740
Papa...  Mama...

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.070
Oh no...

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:14.210
These are memories of my era.

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:57.250
The desires of foolish 
humans reached its peak.

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:03.010
That's when Moment suddenly 
began to rotate backwards.

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:06.720
As though it was responding to the people's 
hearts, Moment went out of control.

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:14.820
Moments around the world simultaneously 
exploded and destroyed the world.

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:18.450
You're lying!

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:22.210
I don't believe that Moment 
went out of control again!

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:24.180
It's the truth.

00:14:24.410 --> 00:14:28.470
It was the fault of foolish 
humans, including ourselves.

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:35.340
These are memories of my era.

00:14:35.340 --> 00:14:42.420
Destiny chose me for some reason, 
and I walked the world alone.

00:14:42.640 --> 00:14:47.700
But there was no one who 
would answer my calls.

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:52.280
Anyone!

00:14:56.930 --> 00:15:02.900
I despaired as I saw the end 
of humanity and history.

00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:06.680
This is our future...

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:13.130
That was...

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:15.730
Our future...

00:15:15.730 --> 00:15:17.600
Will we really perish?

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:30.370
Synchro Summoning...  Our 
speed will lead to that world?

00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:32.440
I don't believe it!

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:37.660
Yusei Fudo, you refuse to face destiny?

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:44.560
Your destiny is heading towards destruction, 
and Synchro Summoning is the cause.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:48.800
You're wrong!  Synchro Summoning 
isn't the symbol of destruction!

00:15:48.980 --> 00:15:51.530
It breaks the limits of destiny!

00:15:51.530 --> 00:15:55.740
That simplistic thinking caused 
the destruction of mankind.

00:15:56.270 --> 00:16:01.210
No!  Our destiny and future 
are still in our hands!

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:03.330
My turn!

00:16:06.790 --> 00:16:10.000
I summon the Tuner Monster Mono Synchron!

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:16.330
Mono Synchron's effect activates!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:20.560
When Mono Synchron is used as Synchro 
Material, the other card becomes Level 1.

00:16:23.680 --> 00:16:25.950
Wave Wall's Level changes from 4 to 1.

00:16:26.880 --> 00:16:31.130
Level 1 Mono Synchron 
tunes Level 1 Wave Wall!

00:16:32.160 --> 00:16:35.700
The wishes come together to 
invite a new world of speed!

00:16:35.700 --> 00:16:37.030
Become the path that lights the way!

00:16:37.810 --> 00:16:39.200
Synchro Summon!

00:16:39.200 --> 00:16:42.970
The Synchro Tuner with the power 
of hope!  Formula Synchron!

00:16:43.340 --> 00:16:49.130
I believe that our bond will open the future!

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:50.820
Clear Mind!

00:16:52.180 --> 00:16:59.500
Level 2 Synchro Tuner Formula Synchron tunes 
Level 8 Synchro Monster Stardust Dragon!

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:03.910
Dreams crystallize to open 
a new door of evolution!

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:05.750
Become the path that lights the way!

00:17:08.310 --> 00:17:09.560
Accel Synchro!

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:19.640
Arise!  Shooting Star Dragon!

00:17:22.370 --> 00:17:24.760
Shooting Star Dragon's effect activates!

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:28.160
Once per turn, I look at the 
top five cards in my deck.

00:17:28.440 --> 00:17:32.130
For every Tuner Monster among 
them, it can attack once!

00:17:34.460 --> 00:17:39.530
This is the moment our bond shows its power!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:45.670
The first card is the Tuner 
Monster Drill Synchron!

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:49.940
The second card is the Tuner 
Monster Debris Dragon!

00:17:50.370 --> 00:17:53.940
The third card is the Tuner 
Monster Nitro Synchron!

00:17:54.460 --> 00:17:58.060
The fourth card is the Tuner 
Monster Quickdraw Synchron!

00:17:58.060 --> 00:17:59.720
And the fifth card!

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:03.080
The Tuner Monster Effect Veiler!

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.720
Now I can attack five times!

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:12.710
Go, Shooting Star Dragon!

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:15.000
Stardust Mirage!

00:18:16.400 --> 00:18:18.250
The first battle!

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:21.140
Attack Granel Attack 3!

00:18:21.280 --> 00:18:26.280
Red Nova Dragon, face Shooting Star Dragon!

00:18:30.360 --> 00:18:34.060
I flip over the Continuous 
Trap Synchro Striker Unit!

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:39.870
This card equips on to a Synchro Monster 
and increases its attack points by 1000!

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:47.900
Due to Granel Carrier's effect, Red 
Nova Dragon's destruction is negated!

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:51.870
But you still take damage!

00:18:55.800 --> 00:18:58.230
Granel lost attack points!

00:18:58.430 --> 00:19:01.580
He can attack continuously and 
decrease Jose's life points!

00:19:01.780 --> 00:19:03.450
The second battle!

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.230
The third battle!

00:19:11.270 --> 00:19:13.340
Attack Granel Attack 3!

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:18.190
The fourth battle!

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:20.440
Attack Granel Top!

00:19:23.560 --> 00:19:24.580
He did it!

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:25.210
Incredible!

00:19:25.610 --> 00:19:28.150
Look at Granel's attack points.

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:31.300
Shooting Star Dragon has more attack points!

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:35.880
The fifth battle!  Attack 
Meklord Emperor Granel!

00:19:43.770 --> 00:19:49.680
When Granel is destroyed, all monsters 
on your field are destroyed!

00:19:54.260 --> 00:20:01.590
During each of my End Phases, Shooting 
Star Dragon loses 800 attack points.

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:04.080
I set two cards and end my turn!

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:14.780
This is our power to open the future!

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:23.060
Synchro Summoning and Accel Synchro 
destroyed your plans and phony future!

00:20:23.080 --> 00:20:27.300
Oh really?  I think you're 
approaching your destiny.

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:31.500
Thanks to you, my field is a burnt field.

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:39.640
But don't worry.  We...  I mean-

00:20:39.910 --> 00:20:41.020
Aporia...

00:20:41.020 --> 00:20:42.510
...will fix destiny!

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:43.410
Aporia?

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:49.140
Now is the time for three souls 
born from despair to become one!

00:21:00.420 --> 00:21:01.690
Took you long enough, Jose.

00:21:02.510 --> 00:21:05.700
It's time for me to battle Yusei Fudo again.

00:21:06.650 --> 00:21:07.950
Me too!

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:35.060
What's happening?

00:21:42.870 --> 00:21:44.610
My name is Aporia.

00:22:05.000 --> 00:22:10.240
If the world is endless, prove it to my heart

00:22:10.380 --> 00:22:15.580
If we shed the same tears, 
let's laugh together

00:22:15.710 --> 00:22:20.950
Freed reality forms phrases 
in the piercing beat

00:22:21.090 --> 00:22:23.690
Our hearts resonate

00:22:23.690 --> 00:22:28.930
As the nameless flower blooms with sound

00:22:29.060 --> 00:22:35.570
We'll find a place for us

00:22:37.470 --> 00:22:42.340
Waking in a dream  Stretch 
our hands toward the future

00:22:42.340 --> 00:22:47.380
Grab and release repeatedly as we search

00:22:48.110 --> 00:22:53.550
Repaint the darkness with 
the colors we envision

00:22:53.550 --> 00:23:02.130
Overlaying memories, bonds 
and hope creates future color

00:23:02.130 --> 00:23:07.730
We will draw it forever
